    "owner_id null is rejected on create and update",
    "unassigned create omits owner_id",
    "unassignment removes owner_id from the preserved full document",
    "Device POST replaces omitted sections rather than merging them",
    "typed read-merge-write preserved SIP, media, call waiting, contact list, timezone, and owner fields during edit",
    "null is rejected for audited optional string fields",
    "empty string clears language, timezone, presence_id, and ringtone values",
    "empty JSON objects decoded as PHP arrays must be omitted before re-encoding"
